  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "little 是常考单词，所以学生一定要掌握其习惯用法，及比较与 few 的用法区别："
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "1) few, a few 用来修饰可数名词；little, a little 用来修饰不可数名词。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "2) a few, a little 表示肯定意义；few, little 表示否定意义。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：I can speak "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "a little"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " English. 我能讲一点英语。"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "He has made "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "a few"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " mistakes in the exam. 他在考试中犯了一些错误。"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "There is "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "little"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " sugar left. I will go to the supermarket to buy some. 几乎没有糖了。我要去超市买一些。"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "Few"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " people came to the meeting. 几乎没人来参加会议。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "3) 在 only 和 quite 后面要用 a few 或 a little，不能用 few 或 little。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如："
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "only a little"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " water 只有一点点水"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "quite a few"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " students 不少学生"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "4) few 和 little 可与 very, so, too 等词连用。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：very "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "few"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 非常少"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "so "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "little"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 如此少"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
